<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd" identifier="pcb-item-2a46b5f29f314d8091ec45e54be7705c" title="sat-c2-u16-imperialism.html qc1" adaptive="true" time-dependent="false">
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response><qti-value>C</qti-value></qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float"><qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value></qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"/>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>show_interaction</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-item-body>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="show_interaction" outcome-identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" show-hide="show" class="qti-margin-0">
      <qti-content-body>
        <p>Which sentence uses &quot;imperialism&quot; correctly?</p>
    <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="true" max-choices="1">
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="A">Rivals grumbled about the chess club&apos;s imperialism after it took the county trophy for the ninth straight year.</qti-simple-choice><qti-simple-choice identifier="B">The two nations&apos; imperialism produced a trade pact that cut import duties equally on both sides of the border.</qti-simple-choice><qti-simple-choice identifier="C">The canal seizure was imperialism at its bluntest: a distant power took the waterway, garrisoned it, and set its tolls for shareholders an ocean away.</qti-simple-choice><qti-simple-choice identifier="D">Opponents attacked the governor&apos;s imperialism when he slashed the militia&apos;s budget, recalled every frontier garrison, and returned their fortresses to the counties.</qti-simple-choice>
    </qti-choice-interaction>
      </qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>

    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-A" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! Imperialism means a nation&apos;s policy of ruling other lands and peoples for its own gain, so it&apos;s not the correct choice here because winning a trophy nine years running is dominance of a competition — no land is ruled and no people governed, however sore the rivals.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-B" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! Imperialism means a nation&apos;s policy of ruling other lands and peoples for its own gain, so it&apos;s not the correct choice here because a pact that cuts duties equally on both sides is an agreement between equals — mutual benefit is the opposite of one nation commanding another.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-C" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Correct! Imperialism means a nation&apos;s policy of ruling other lands and peoples for its own gain, so it&apos;s the correct answer because a distant power that takes a waterway, garrisons it, and sets its tolls for shareholders an ocean away is running someone else&apos;s land for home-country profit.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-D" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! Imperialism means a nation&apos;s policy of extending its power over other lands, so it&apos;s not the correct choice here because slashing the militia and recalling every frontier garrison is power being pulled back — retrenchment runs in the opposite direction from empire.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
  </qti-item-body>
  <qti-response-processing>
    <qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-if>
      <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">A</qti-base-value></qti-match>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-A</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-if>
      <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">B</qti-base-value></qti-match>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-B</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-if>
      <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">C</qti-base-value></qti-match>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">1</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-C</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">completed</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-if>
      <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">D</qti-base-value></qti-match>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-D</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
  </qti-response-processing>
</qti-assessment-item>
